        <mxCell id="qgXxldIbosjhFXhmw3Tx-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;Design a WhatsApp system with proper following requirements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. User Service&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Chat Service&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Group Service&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Optimize the chat service for handling the millions of request.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Specify the type of connection used int the design.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Determine how the design will be done for the last seen functionality.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Implement CDC Pipeline&amp;nbsp; int the same architecture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
